  "description": "Noah makes a decent living as an immortal. Hiring off his body as a human shield to high-paying clients has earned him a comfortable enough life. The only real drawback to his supernatural ability is that whoever is near him after he returns to life inexplicably falls in love with him. He's already explained that to Allen, his new employer, but he strangely doesn't seem phased by Noah's warnings...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
